November 5, 2006 
<br><br>
Kayenta Mine <br>
Peabody Western Coal Company<br>
Kayenta, Navajo County, Arizona<br>
 ID No. 02-01195

<br><br>
Accident Investigators 
<br><br>
David Head <br>
